                             MEDITATIONS ON WISDOM

Preface

Wisdom is the principal thing; therefore get wisdom: and
with all thy getting get understanding. (Prov 4:7). The
need for Wisdom in living a meaningful life cannot be
overemphasized. It is therefore expedient that you desire
and appropriate divine wisdom into your life.

These meditations when applied effectively will yield the
result of a mighty operation of the Spirit of wisdom in
your life. Do well to find a suitable atmosphere and
engage effectively. Prayerfully confess and prophetically
declare these scriptures into your life repeatedly,
continually and routinely.

It takes time for the things of the spirit to crystalise so
these meditations will become tangible in your life after a
length of time.
